  abilityDesc: 17 combo powerful Dark attack on all foes, powerful Dark attack on
    single foe, slightly boosts OD gauge, hugely boosts Atk, Def, Rec for 3 turns,
    adds Fire, Water, Earth, Thunder elements to attack for 3 turns & boosts OD gauge
    fill rate at turn's end for 3 turns
